      "problem": "| $x$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,1)$ | $\\frac{4}{5}$ | $\\frac{1}{5}$ |\n\nFind the $\\text{E}[X\\,|\\,Y=1]$ given that the conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,1)$ is shown in the table above.",
